---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const page = {
  "title": "The look-round — Ey-aye",
  "description": "A free hour at your place, watching how the work flows, and a one-page aye/nay list on where AI would save real time. No pitch.",
  "path": "/look-round/",
  "og": [
    ["og:title", "The look-round — Ey-aye"],
    ["og:description", "A free hour at your place, watching how the work flows, and a one-page aye/nay list on where AI would save real time. No pitch."],
    ["og:url", "https://ey-aye.co.uk/look-round/"],
    ["og:type", "website"]
  ],
  "current": "what"
};
---
<Base {...page}>
<section class="wrap offer-hero-wrap">
  <div class="offer-hero">
    <div class="kicker">Step one</div>
    <h1>The look-round<span class="stop">.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">An hour at your place, watching how the work actually flows. You get a straight aye or nay on where AI would save real time in your business and where it'd just be a toy. No slides, no pitch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap offer-page">
  <div class="main">
    <h2>What happens</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We come to you, at a time the business is actually running, not a quiet Friday afternoon.</li>
      <li>We watch the admin: the bookings, the quotes, the chasing, the screens you click round. We ask what's eating the mornings.</li>
      <li>We look at what you're already paying for (most businesses have an AI subscription nobody's using properly).</li>
      <li>Within two days you get one page: three or four ayes with a rough cost and a rough saving, and the nays with the reason.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What you leave with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A clear idea of whether any of this is worth your money. Sometimes the answer's nay, and we'll say so.</li>
      <li>Usually one thing you can do yourself that afternoon with the tools you've already got.</li>
      <li>No obligation. Roughly half of look-rounds turn into a half-day; the rest got a useful hour.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>Any business in Harrogate, Knaresborough, Ripon, Wetherby or within an hour's drive, from a one-person clinic to a sixty-person workshop. If you're bigger than that or outside the area, the <a href="/ai-lead/">fractional AI lead</a> page is probably the one you want.</p>
    <p class="next-offer">Next step, if there is one: <a href="/half-day/">the half-day</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="aside">
    <div class="price">Free</div>
    <div>One hour, at your place. A one-page aye/nay list within two days.</div>
    <a href="/#book" class="btn btn-teal">Book an hour</a>
    <div class="small">No contract, no follow-up calls you didn't ask for.</div>
  </aside>
</section>
</Base>
